WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.092 --> 00:00:02.675
(upbeat music)

00:00:04.148 --> 00:00:05.351
- Yo.

00:00:05.351 --> 00:00:07.468
(intense music)

00:00:07.468 --> 00:00:10.131
- What are you wearing?
- They're just shorts.

00:00:10.131 --> 00:00:13.533
- You can't just be
rocking shorts like that.

00:00:13.533 --> 00:00:14.458
- They're just my legs.

00:00:14.458 --> 00:00:16.683
- Why do you look like The
Rock from the waist down?

00:00:16.683 --> 00:00:19.290
Doesn't our office have
some sort of dress code?

00:00:19.290 --> 00:00:22.329
You just decide to walk up
here and act like it's no big

00:00:22.329 --> 00:00:24.971
deal that you have the
greatest calves of all time?

00:00:24.971 --> 00:00:26.422
Do you have soccer tryouts after work?

00:00:26.422 --> 00:00:27.554
Why are you dressed like a teacher

00:00:27.554 --> 00:00:29.333
who I would run into at a Blockbuster?

00:00:29.333 --> 00:00:30.166
Why are you dressed like you're

00:00:30.166 --> 00:00:31.991
about to give me swim lessons?

00:00:31.991 --> 00:00:32.919
- It's hot out.

00:00:32.919 --> 00:00:34.725
- Is every day leg day for you?

00:00:34.725 --> 00:00:36.603
Why do your calves look
like they could beat me up?

00:00:36.603 --> 00:00:38.044
I'll bet your mom had to get a C-section

00:00:38.044 --> 00:00:39.489
because of those bad boys.

00:00:39.489 --> 00:00:40.775
If the apocalypse happened right now,

00:00:40.775 --> 00:00:41.970
I'd eat you immediately.

00:00:41.970 --> 00:00:43.822
Have you never used an escalator?

00:00:43.822 --> 00:00:45.119
Have you ever ridden in a car?

00:00:45.119 --> 00:00:47.889
Are you some sort of experiment
between a boy and a horse?

00:00:47.889 --> 00:00:49.964
You could have gotten some
kind of scholarship for those.

00:00:49.964 --> 00:00:52.916
Those calves are the size
of a calf, as in baby cow.

00:00:52.916 --> 00:00:54.593
Lebron James would definitely go back home

00:00:54.593 --> 00:00:55.654
to play for those calves.

00:00:55.654 --> 00:00:57.185
Do you normally wear baggy
pants and because of your calves

00:00:57.185 --> 00:00:58.865
they look like skinny jeans?

00:00:58.865 --> 00:01:01.013
You look like you could hike
a mountain in six seconds.

00:01:01.013 --> 00:01:02.580
Have you ever sat down?

00:01:02.580 --> 00:01:04.109
Tell me why I wanna take a can of Pam

00:01:04.109 --> 00:01:06.451
and just spray your calves right now.

00:01:06.451 --> 00:01:07.501
I cannot take you seriously

00:01:07.501 --> 00:01:09.498
when you're wearing those Daisy Dukes.

00:01:09.498 --> 00:01:10.331
How?

00:01:10.331 --> 00:01:12.681
Look at that, oh my goodness.

00:01:12.681 --> 00:01:14.677
Do I have to send your
calves a Christmas card now?

00:01:14.677 --> 00:01:16.007
- Hey, eyes up here.

00:01:16.007 --> 00:01:17.657
- When you run, do your calves chafe?

00:01:17.657 --> 00:01:18.940
I'm sure every girlfriend you've ever had

00:01:18.940 --> 00:01:20.530
has motorboated those puppies.

00:01:20.530 --> 00:01:22.964
Did you calves accidentally
sink the Titanic?

00:01:22.964 --> 00:01:24.676
Why do you look like you
live on the 67th floor

00:01:24.676 --> 00:01:26.680
of a hotel with a broken elevator?

00:01:26.680 --> 00:01:27.930
- Are you done?

00:01:29.779 --> 00:01:31.385
- Yeah, I'm done.

00:01:31.385 --> 00:01:33.890
Sorry, I was just,
maybe you should warn me

00:01:33.890 --> 00:01:36.506
next time you wear shorts to the office.

00:01:36.506 --> 00:01:39.589
(gentle music)
Gosh.

00:01:41.206 --> 00:01:43.789
(upbeat music)

